# Leave this empty to use preview mode in Expo development
# (data saved on the phone). Release builds require the API URL.
# For the real app, set the API address of the Express server.
#
# Important for Expo Go on a physical phone: use your computer's Wi-Fi/LAN IP,
# not localhost. The backend prints the correct address when it starts.
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.25:4000
